{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1co-9-1","title":"1 Corinthians 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He shows his liberty; 7 and that the minister ought to live by the Gospel; 15 yet that himself has of his own accord abstained, 18 to be either chargeable unto them, 22 or offensive unto any, in matters indifferent. 24 Our life is like unto a race.</p>\n<p>I not an. 2,3; 1:1; 15:8,9; Ac 9:15; 13:2; 14:4; 22:14,15; 16:17,18; Ro 1:1,5 Ro 11:13; 2Co 11:5; 12:11,12; Ga 1:1,15-17; 2:7,8; 1Ti 2:7 2Ti 1:11; Tit 1:1-3 am I not free. 19; Ga 5:1 have. 15:8; Ac 9:3,5,17; 18:9; 22:6-8,14-21; 23:11; 26:16-18 are. 3:6; 4:14,15; Ac 18:8-11; 2Co 6:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-2","title":"1 Corinthians 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>for. Joh 6:27; 2Co 3:1-3; 12:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-3","title":"1 Corinthians 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>answer. Ac 22:1; 25:16; Php 1:7,17; 2Ti 4:16; *Gr: them. 14:37; 2Co 10:7,8; 12:16-19; 13:3,5,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-4","title":"1 Corinthians 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>we. 7-14; Mt 10:10; Lu 10:7; Ga 6:6; 1Th 2:6; 2Th 3:8,9; 1Ti 5:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-5","title":"1 Corinthians 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>to lead. 1Ti 3:2; 4:3; Tit 1:6; Heb 13:4 a sister. 7:15,39; So 4:9,10,12; 5:1,2; Ro 16:1; 1Ti 5:2 wife. or, woman. the brethren. Mt 12:46-50; 13:55; Mr 6:3; Lu 6:15; Joh 2:12; Ac 1:14; Ga 1:19 Cephas. 1:12; Mt 8:14; Mr 1:30; Joh 1:42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-6","title":"1 Corinthians 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Barnabas. Ac 4:36; 11:22; 13:1,2,50; 14:12; 15:36,37 have. 4:11,12; Ac 18:3; 20:34,35; 1Th 2:9; 2Th 3:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-7","title":"1 Corinthians 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>goeth. 2Co 10:4,5; 1Ti 1:18; 6:12; 2Ti 2:3,4; 4:7 planteth. 3:6-8; De 20:6; Pr 27:18; So 8:12 or. Jer 23:2,3; Joh 21:15-17; Ac 20:28; 1Pe 5:2 eateth not of the milk. Pr 27:27; Isa 7:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-8","title":"1 Corinthians 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>as. 7:40; Ro 6:19; 1Th 2:13; 4:8 or. 14:34; Isa 8:20; Ro 3:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-9","title":"1 Corinthians 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Thou. De 25:4; 1Ti 5:18 Doth. Nu 22:28-35; De 5:14; Ps 104:27; 145:15,16; 147:8,9; Jon 4:11 Mt 6:26-30; Lu 12:24-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-10","title":"1 Corinthians 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>For. Mt 24:22; Ro 15:4; 2Co 4:15 that ploweth. 3:9; Lu 17:7,8; Joh 4:35-38; 2Ti 2:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-11","title":"1 Corinthians 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>sown. Mal 3:8,9; Mt 10:10; Ro 15:27; Ga 6:6 a great. 2Ki 5:13; 2Co 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-12","title":"1 Corinthians 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>others. 2Co 11:20 are not. 2; 4:14,15 Nevertheless. 15,18; Ac 20:31-34; 2Co 11:7-10; 12:13,14; 1Th 2:6-9; 2Th 3:8,9 but. 4:11,12; 6:7 hinder. Ge 24:56; Ne 4:8; Lu 11:52; Ro 15:22; 2Co 11:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-13","title":"1 Corinthians 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>they. 10:18; Le 6:16-18,26; 7:6-8; Nu 5:9,10; 18:8-20; De 10:9; 18:1-5 1Sa 2:28 live. or, feed.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-14","title":"1 Corinthians 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>ordained. 4; Mt 10:10; Lu 10:7; Ga 6:6; 1Ti 5:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-15","title":"1 Corinthians 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I have. 12; 4:12; Ac 8:3; 20:34; 1Th 2:9; 2Th 3:8 neither. 2Co 11:9-12; 12:13-18 for. Mt 18:6; Ac 20:24; Php 1:20-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-16","title":"1 Corinthians 9:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I have. Ro 4:2; 15:17 for. Jer 1:17; 20:7,9; Am 3:8; 7:15; Ac 4:20; 9:6,15; 26:16-20; Ro 1:14 woe. Isa 6:5; Lu 9:62; Col 4:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-17","title":"1 Corinthians 9:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>if I. 1Ch 28:9; 29:5,9,14; Ne 11:2; Isa 6:8; 2Co 8:12; Phm 1:14; 1Pe 5:2-4 have. 3:8,14; Mt 10:41 against. Ex 4:13,14; Jer 20:9; Eze 3:14; Jon 1:3; 4:1-3; Mal 1:10 dispensation. 16; 4:1; Mt 24:25; Lu 12:42; Ga 2:7; Eph 3:2-8; Php 1:17; Col 1:25 1Th 2:4; 1Ti 1:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-18","title":"1 Corinthians 9:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>when. 6,7; 10:33; 2Co 4:5; 11:7-9; 12:13-18; 1Th 2:6; 2Th 3:8,9 that I. 7:31; 8:9; Ro 14:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-19","title":"1 Corinthians 9:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>I be. 1; Ga 5:1 I made. 10:33; Mt 20:26-28; Joh 13:14,15; Ro 1:14; 15:2; 2Co 4:5; Ga 5:13 that. 20-22; 7:16; Pr 11:30; Mt 18:15; Ro 11:14; 1Ti 4:16; 2Ti 2:10 Jas 5:19,20; 1Pe 3:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-20","title":"1 Corinthians 9:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>unto. Ac 16:3; 17:2,3; 18:18; 21:20-26 are under. Ro 3:19; 6:14,15; Ga 4:5,21; 5:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-21","title":"1 Corinthians 9:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>them. Ac 15:28; 16:4; 21:25; Ro 2:12,14; Ga 2:3,4,12-14; 3:2 not. 7:19-22; Ps 119:32; Mt 5:17-20; Ro 7:22,25; 8:4; 13:8-10 Ga 5:13,14,22,23; Eph 6:1-3; 1Th 4:1,2; Tit 2:2-12; Heb 8:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-22","title":"1 Corinthians 9:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>To the weak. 8:13; Ro 15:1; 2Co 11:29; Ga 6:1 I am. 10:33 that I might by. 19; 7:16; Ro 11:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-23","title":"1 Corinthians 9:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>for. 12; Mr 8:35; 2Co 2:4; Ga 2:5; 2Ti 2:10 that. 25-27; 2Ti 2:6; Heb 3:1,14; 1Pe 5:1; 1Jo 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-24","title":"1 Corinthians 9:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>they. Ho 12:10 run in. Ps 19:5; Ec 9:11; Jer 12:5 so run. 26; Ga 2:2; 5:7; Php 2:16; 3:14; 2Ti 4:7,8; Heb 12:1; Jas 1:12 Re 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-9-25","title":"1 Corinthians 9:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapte